you cause i'm Mr.Vain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:11.620" end="05:15.140">I know what i want and i want it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:15.140" end="05:18.740">I want you cause i'm Mr.Vain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:18.740" end="05:22.180">I know what i want and i want it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:22.180" end="05:25.840">I want you cause i'm Mr.Vain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:25.840" end="05:29.560">I know what i want and i want it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:29.560" end="05:33.560">I want you cause i'm Mr.Vain</p></div></body></tt>